# The complete public surface of libmetal_pjrt_native.dylib (ld64
# -exported_symbols_list; C names, hence the leading underscore).
#
# Everything else in this image -- XLA, MLIR/LLVM, StableHLO, protobuf, absl,
# and the executor runtime -- becomes private extern.  That is not cosmetic:
# dyld coalesces WEAK DEFINITIONS across images by name, so a plugin that
# exports protobuf's `AddDescriptors`/arena symbols binds them to whatever
# protobuf is already loaded (TensorFlow's, array_record's) and executes a
# foreign descriptor pool -- SIGSEGV at dlopen, both load orders (with this
# plugin first, TF's LLVM instead aborts on duplicate CommandLine options).
# It reached every keras / gemma-lib / maxtext benchmark row.
#
# Keep this list at exactly two entries.  A third export is a decision about
# what this plugin promises the process it is loaded into.
_GetPjrtApi
_metaljax_native_set_callback_trampoline
